docs {
  ## Create New Trip

  Creates a new trip request in the dispatch system with passenger details and location information.

  ### Request Body
  - `pickup_location`: Full address where passenger will be picked up
  - `dropoff_location`: Full address where passenger wants to go
  - `passenger_name`: Name of the passenger (optional)
  - `passenger_phone`: Contact phone number (optional)
  - `passenger_email`: Contact email address (optional)
  - `driver_id`: ID of assigned driver (optional - can be assigned later)
  - `notes`: Special instructions or notes (optional)

  ### Response
  ```json
  {
    "message": "Trip created",
    "trip_id": 5
  }
  ```

  ### Test Script
  ```javascript
  if (res.getStatus() === 200) {
    const response = res.getBody();
    console.log(`✅ Trip created successfully with ID: ${response.trip_id}`);

    // Store the trip ID for follow-up requests
    bru.setVar('new_trip_id', response.trip_id);
  } else {
    console.log('❌ Failed to create trip');
  }
  ```

  ### Common Trip Creation Scenarios

  **Standard Trip:**
  ```json
  {
    "pickup_location": "Shop A, Main Street",
    "dropoff_location": "Office B, Central Ave",
    "passenger_name": "John Doe",
    "passenger_phone": "0771234567"
  }
  ```

  **Airport Transfer:**
  ```json
  {
    "pickup_location": "Joshua Mqabuko Nkomo International Airport",
    "dropoff_location": "City Center Hotel, Bulawayo",
    "passenger_name": "Business Traveler",
    "passenger_phone": "0779876543",
    "notes": "Flight arrives at 14:30, please wait at arrivals"
  }
  ```

  **Corporate Account:**
  ```json
  {
    "pickup_location": "Company HQ, 10th Avenue",
    "dropoff_location": "Airport",
    "passenger_name": "CEO - Monthly Account",
    "passenger_email": "ceo@company.com",
    "notes": "Charge to Company Account #12345"
  }
  ```
}